    </expertiseList>
    <grid>
      <Value>
{"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockGrid":[{"contentUdi":"umb://element/79196e1233f74db58d3a56cf373205d7","areas":[],"columnSpan":12,"rowSpan":1}]},"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"9a4f7c2e-1b3d-4e8a-bf01-7d62a8f5c930","udi":"umb://element/79196e1233f74db58d3a56cf373205d7","content":"\u003cp\u003eIn 2019 Roadlab assisted HHO Consulting Engineers to improve the container stacking efficiency of Transnet’s Cape Town Port Terminal, part of a multi-million rand upgrade to critical infrastructure in the Western Cape.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/sbll421m/vlcsnap-2020-02-13-16h44m17s392.png\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRoadlab conducted Falling Weight Deflectometer (FWD) testing, concrete coring and sampling for the project between 2019 and 2020.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eData received would enable benchmarking of the various layers to include in a pavement loading analysis and derive pavement-strengthening options for improved container stacking efficiency.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur testing and quality assurance work within the port terminals formed part of a multi-phase, multi-billion rand upgrade to a facility that is pivotal to the regional economy.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/jyrhe0e3/ct-harbour-1.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/ceohlvfi/ct-harbour-3.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-h3 heading-h2\"\u003eIf you need confidence in your work site or construction materials, reach out to us below.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n"}],"settingsData":[]}
</Value>
    </grid>
    <heroContent>
      <Value><![CDATA[<p>With a fleet of over 100 vehicles, mobile laboratories and widespread coverage, Roadlab is your go-to partner for materials testing, no matter your location. </p>]]></Value>
    </heroContent>
